;;This block pinned a SHADOWED LET BINDING inside DPL-UR::URC_PrimordialPrices: the function bound
;;five ids positionally out of URC_PrimordialIDs, then rebound them by name from DALOS, so the
;;first block was dead code that nobody dared delete because nobody could tell which half was
